    "detailed_description": "In Antidotera, you step into the shoes of researcher enlisted by the government to tackle a global health crisis. A deadly epidemic is haunting the population, and finding a cure is up to you.<br><br>Sent to a mysterious, resource-rich island, you must explore its untamed wilderness to discover and harness the natural ingredients needed to develop powerful potions and medicines. The island, long abandoned and steeped in secrecy, holds untold potential\u2014but also countless dangers. As you delve deeper into its lush forests and rugged landscapes, you'll uncover uncategorized herbs, exotic mushrooms, and other rare materials that could be the key to ending the epidemic. Your mission is clear: survive, gather, experiment, and deliver life-saving potions to the government, all while navigating the perils of the wild.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><strong>Exploring Resourceful Island</strong>: Venture into the heart of a deserted island teeming with untapped resources. Discover hidden herbs, mushrooms, plants, and other natural materials that could hold the secret to combating the epidemic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/0d0d10f47d80b7fbd44984a36ee9e39a.poster.avif?t=1741817321\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/0d0d10f47d80b7fbd44984a36ee9e39a.webm?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/0d0d10f47d80b7fbd44984a36ee9e39a.mp4?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gathering Wild Materials</strong>: Scour the lush forests and rugged terrains to gather essential items. Every material you find could be crucial in your quest for survival and in creating powerful potions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/bed4c4a0c2c0377644c5f4625ed1c6e9.poster.avif?t=1741817321\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/bed4c4a0c2c0377644c5f4625ed1c6e9.webm?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/bed4c4a0c2c0377644c5f4625ed1c6e9.mp4?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Mixing or Crafting Materials</strong>: Experiment with a variety of ingredients. Crush, cook, and combine wild herbs, fungi, and edible plants to concoct unique potions. Use your gathered resources to build shelters and sustain yourself in the wilderness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/3e3a5399439fc441d3100243c2d85334.poster.avif?t=1741817321\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/3e3a5399439fc441d3100243c2d85334.webm?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/3e3a5399439fc441d3100243c2d85334.mp4?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Provide Beneficial Potions</strong>: Once you've created a potent potion, send it to the government via helicopter, which will periodically arrive to collect your latest discoveries. Your efforts will directly contribute to the fight against the epidemic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/156a47226792be12166adfeafbb0ad05.poster.avif?t=1741817321\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/156a47226792be12166adfeafbb0ad05.webm?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/156a47226792be12166adfeafbb0ad05.mp4?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "In Antidotera, you step into the shoes of researcher enlisted by the government to tackle a global health crisis. A deadly epidemic is haunting the population, and finding a cure is up to you.<br><br>Sent to a mysterious, resource-rich island, you must explore its untamed wilderness to discover and harness the natural ingredients needed to develop powerful potions and medicines. The island, long abandoned and steeped in secrecy, holds untold potential\u2014but also countless dangers. As you delve deeper into its lush forests and rugged landscapes, you'll uncover uncategorized herbs, exotic mushrooms, and other rare materials that could be the key to ending the epidemic. Your mission is clear: survive, gather, experiment, and deliver life-saving potions to the government, all while navigating the perils of the wild.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><strong>Exploring Resourceful Island</strong>: Venture into the heart of a deserted island teeming with untapped resources. Discover hidden herbs, mushrooms, plants, and other natural materials that could hold the secret to combating the epidemic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/0d0d10f47d80b7fbd44984a36ee9e39a.poster.avif?t=1741817321\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/0d0d10f47d80b7fbd44984a36ee9e39a.webm?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132610/extras/0d0d10f47d80b7fbd44984a36ee9e39a.mp4?t=1741817321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gathering Wild Materials</strong>: Scour the lush forests and rugged terrains to gather essential items. Every material you find could be crucial in your quest for survival and in creating powerful potions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_i